---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="About — SageCG Venture Studio"
  description="Operating since 1998, SageCG is a national boutique venture studio with dual anchors in Virginia and South Carolina. We build, operate, and own a focused portfolio across Global Trade, GovTech, EdTech, and B2B SaaS."
>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] bg-studio-grid">
    <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-radial-fade"></div>
    <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 pt-16 pb-14">
      <p class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-[var(--color-muted)]">About</p>
      <h1 class="mt-4 font-display text-5xl sm:text-6xl tracking-tight leading-[1.02]">
        A national studio, <br />driven by operator experience.
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-[var(--color-ink)]/80 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
        Sage Consulting Group started as a consultancy in 1998 in Virginia. Today, we are a national boutique venture studio with dual anchors in Virginia and South Carolina. We aren't passive investors — we are the original architects and operators of every company we start.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Body -->
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 pt-12 pb-16 prose-about">
    <h2>What a venture studio is</h2>
    <p>
      An accelerator picks winners. A holding company buys them. A venture studio <em>builds</em> them — from the inside, using a shared team, shared infrastructure, and a long-term operator mindset.
    </p>
    <p>
      Each company in our portfolio is one we started ourselves or grew out of work we were already doing. They keep independent brands, products, and economics. The studio is the spine; the companies are the body.
    </p>

    <h2>How we decide what to build</h2>
    <ol>
      <li><strong>Real pain.</strong> If we can’t point to a specific person miserable about a specific problem, we don’t ship.</li>
      <li><strong>Fair market.</strong> Big enough to matter, small enough to be ignored by giants.</li>
      <li><strong>Operator advantage.</strong> Something about the team, the network, or the stack gives us a real edge.</li>
      <li><strong>Path to durability.</strong> A plausible road to a profitable, lasting business — not just a fundable one.</li>
    </ol>

    <h2>What we share across companies</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Design system, brand toolkit, and component library</li>
      <li>Engineering platform, CI/CD, observability</li>
      <li>Back office: legal, finance, HR, vendor relationships</li>
      <li>Hard-won playbooks for launch, growth, and support</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>What we don’t do</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Take outside capital for the studio itself</li>
      <li>Chase trends we can’t operate inside of</li>
      <li>Pretend to be bigger than we are</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Get in touch</h2>
    <p>
      Working on something adjacent? Looking to partner, sell to us, or join one of the portfolio teams? <a href="/contact">Say hello</a>.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-20 border-t border-[var(--color-rule)] pt-12">
      <h2 class="!mt-0">The Sage Stack</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-muted)] mb-8">
        We maintain a shared engineering spine across all portfolio companies — allowing us to move from statutory or domain model to production software with high reliability.
      </p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 not-prose">
        <div class="rounded-2xl studio-panel p-5">
          <h4 class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-[var(--color-accent)]">Frontend</h4>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)]">Astro 5 · React 18 · Next.js</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-[var(--color-muted)] mt-1">Tailwind CSS · PWA &amp; Capacitor</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl studio-panel p-5">
          <h4 class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-[var(--color-accent)]">Compute &amp; Edge</h4>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)]">Cloudflare · Firebase · Python</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-[var(--color-muted)] mt-1">Workers · Gen 2 Functions · Cloud Run</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl studio-panel p-5">
          <h4 class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-[var(--color-accent)]">Data &amp; Storage</h4>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)]">D1 SQLite · Firestore · R2</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-[var(--color-muted)] mt-1">Bi-Temporal Statutory JSON Vaults</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl studio-panel p-5">
          <h4 class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-[var(--color-accent)]">Intelligence</h4>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)]">Deterministic Rules + AI</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-[var(--color-muted)] mt-1">Google Gemini · Anthropic Claude</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style is:global>
  .prose-about { color: var(--color-ink); font-size: 1.0625rem; line-height: 1.75; }
  .prose-about h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.875rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-top: 2.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .prose-about h2:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
  .prose-about p { margin: 1rem 0; }
  .prose-about ul, .prose-about ol { margin: 1rem 0; padding-left: 1.25rem; }
  .prose-about ul { list-style: disc; }
  .prose-about ol { list-style: decimal; }
  .prose-about li { margin: 0.35rem 0; }
  .prose-about a {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
    text-decoration-color: var(--color-rule);
  }
  .prose-about a:hover { text-decoration-color: var(--color-accent); }
  .prose-about strong { font-weight: 600; }
  .prose-about em { font-family: var(--font-serif); font-style: italic; }
</style>
